                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Edeke Solomon atiar, “Naarai kejaas nu otaukon, kwabo mam ilipit abar, akerianut, karaida aibuses, karaida aijar naka ŋul kalukilaito jo, kwabo mam ilipit aibut apaarasia nuipu; konye ilipit acoa ka aijen kanukon, tetere itubokini ikatuŋa, luketarau jo ekabakakec: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
